;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\z50.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>“The Droga Refining Method”
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This book was written in Shiyo 342. About 460 years ago, then.<PG>
Let's see... Precautions―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga shall not be made heedlessly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Droga shall not be abused heedlessly.</STYLE><PG>
When <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> and I <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="たいじ">faced off</STYLE>, I read the keyword 'drugs' off <STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE> by intuition.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My deduction is that <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> used some kind of drug and gained physical abilities beyond any normal person's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could this Droga be what makes that possible?<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Ingredients: Arata cherry roots, 100 </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="もんめ">monme</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">（about 375 grams）, and water.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The water should preferably be reasonably clean, such as groundwater.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Tools to prepare: a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, a fire, and an iron plate.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
It doesn't seem to need anything very difficult.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
To summarize the method―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Crush the Arata cherry roots to the size of beans, put them in a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and add enough water to submerge all the roots.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Then heat the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, stirring, for about 3 days.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Take care not to scorch it, and when the water runs low, add water as needed.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">When a pungent smell arises, stop, and leave it as it is for one day.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The source of this pungent smell is falsificaso, so take care not to inhale it, by covering the face or the like.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
―There it is, falsificaso.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Falsificaso, produced in the process of making Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, so falsificaso means a fake of Droga.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">After one day, the liquid in the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="つぼ">pot</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> separates into four layers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the very top, impurities that float on water, such as root residue.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The second layer, a clear liquid: falsificaso.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The third layer, a pink liquid: Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">At the very bottom, impurities that have settled.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The tree roots, the falsificaso and the impurities are not needed, so discard them.</STYLE><PG>
Discard the falsificaso?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now it's being made in a big hurry as a ritual implement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Discard that?<PG>
So at the time this was written, there was no tradition of using falsificaso as a ritual implement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means that, for some reason, falsificaso came to be used as a ritual implement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The reason falsificaso came to be used...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, none of that matters now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The finishing steps seem to start on the next page.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Run the pink Droga solution through a </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ろか">filter</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, then drip it onto a heated iron plate to drive off the water.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Before long, pink crystals form.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This is Droga.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">By dripping more Droga solution onto the crystal, it can be made larger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A piece the size of a walnut can be used on about 1000 people.</STYLE><PG>
I see. It takes time, but there doesn't seem to be any difficult work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the next page, how to use Droga.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">When using Droga, heat it directly over a flame and inhale the smoke.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">One is then granted the strength of a demon god for about an hour.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">However, take care, as one unaccustomed to it may become overexcited and turn violent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Also, if there are those present who are not using it, take ample care in its handling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">To inhale the smoke efficiently, it is best used in an enclosed space where possible, or upwind of the subject.</STYLE><PG>
This is just straight-up a stimulant...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If someone with that kind of strength got overexcited and turned violent, it would be a disaster.<PG>
So it ends on the next page.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nothing about green eyes, and no detailed explanation of falsificaso either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, I'll take a look at the last page.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only the last page was written in a clearly different style.
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">If Droga is dissolved in distilled water and given by intramuscular injection, the effect lasts a shorter time, but an excessive state of agitation can be prevented.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The amount is about 10～30cc.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">If falsificaso is administered to one of the third generation who harbors murderous intent, the signs of curse-killing can be suppressed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Addendum, Shiyo 735</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE> Niimura<PG>
Curse-killing, the third generation, falsificaso―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unless I know what curse-killing even means in the first place...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this person called <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE> Niimura―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, the half-open door slowly opened.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Ah! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Captain Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">! Have you at last found the room we sought!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Actually, this room's crammed tight..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, a narrow room with lots of books, a table and chairs―
{PAUSE ""}
even the two of us, small as we were, found it cramped.<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"You were upstairs a really long time. Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"There was tons of interesting-looking stuff! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Like weird masks, and white robes that aren't red! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　And also... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">this!</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">　This here's a real find, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Captain</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> was holding was a single old book.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The book's title was―
{PAUSE ""}
“When Boys and Girls Become Adults in Body”...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, did you read this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"There were all manner of nude pictures in it! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Boy, smut really is the same in every age and every land! </STYLE>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　This is a dirty book from the old days! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　They call it </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="しゅんが">shunga</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\春画.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Shunga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its history goes back a full 5000 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In Japan, it was called ensokuzu（ensokuzu, osokuzu）, 
{PAUSE ""}
or osokuzu no e（osokuzu no we）.<PG>
About 200 years ago, the government of the day tried to crack down on shunga. As a countermeasure, it's said, the authors, artists and publishers marked the pictures with hidden signatures, so no one could tell who they were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Most of the famous artists worked on them, and it is said that even artists of famous schools drew them.<PG>
In other words, shunga made full use of the highest-ranking techniques of the ukiyo-e of the time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> said, such things can be called universal in every age and every land.<PG>
...Wait, none of that matters!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, why would something like that be on the floor above...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"Geez, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! This kind of thing is for grown-ups to read... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Hand it over here, now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh my! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're just saying that so you can snatch my dirty book, aren't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> complained, but held out the book anyway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And as a formality, 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">just</STYLE> 
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">to</STYLE> 
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">be</STYLE> 
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="・">sure,</STYLE> 
{PAUSE ""}
for safety's sake, I flip through the book myself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Ah, this isn't shunga, it's more like a health-and-PE textbook.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It describes, in pointlessly fine detail, how to deal with the children of this settlement as they grow up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">! I can't read this writing, so read it to me at bedtime! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　You know, one of those bedtime stories for kids?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"What idiot reads a kid a dirty book at bedtime!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ahahaha! That comeback just now was just like </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Haruka-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're so cute! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　And it's not a dirty book, it's shunga. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you have no class!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Grrr...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a vulgar debate with <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE>, I'm at a disadvantage...! This genius girl's blunder of a lifetime...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just now, for an instant, I saw something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I flipped back through the pages I'd riffled past.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Captain Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, it appears you've found yourself a page of interest! So you're human after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, sorry, be quiet a sec."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Huh? Oh, okay..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Just now, there was definitely... 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Definitely...!
