<STYLE ID="1">“Green-Eye Curse-Killing”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Read 'suigan jusatsu,' I suppose?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why would a book teaching about growing up have something like this...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And at the very start―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">A green-eyed boy, raise as he is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">A green-eyed girl, kill as soon as she is born.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what's wrong...? Are you okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked into <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan's</STYLE> eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> looked into my eyes too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We are green-eyed―<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, thank you. This is what I was looking for. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">It looks like this talks about green eyes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"R-really!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死ぬ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> stared hard at the book too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, can you read this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yeah, this much is a piece of cake. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Letting <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> hear this opening...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After all, it says to kill a green-eyed girl when she's born...<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, make sure you let me hear it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> being the only one who knows, and me not knowing? I'd hate that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">Okay. But I think there's something really scary written in it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Got it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I read the rest aloud, translating it so <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> could understand too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When a green-eyed girl has her first period, within a few days she is </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="さいな">tormented</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> by unbearable murderous intent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There is only one way to cure it: the death of the person who is the object of that murderous intent.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">When the target dies, the green-eyed child is enveloped in supreme happiness and pleasure, and the murderous intent swiftly vanishes as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Green-eyed children are cursed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Hence, a killing by a cursed child is called curse-killing.</STYLE><PG>
Green-eyed girls... killing people...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I haven't gotten mine yet, and I haven't killed anybody, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Yeah, it's okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gripped the hand of an uneasy-looking <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at her age, it wouldn't be strange if <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> had her first period any day now.<PG>
The mechanism of the murderous intent, and who becomes the target of the killing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unless I figure this out, I'll only end up frightening <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚明るい.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Green-eyed children, both boys and girls, are born once every few years.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Furthermore, if a child is born green-eyed, its </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="ていまい">younger siblings</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will without exception be green-eyed as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The mother possesses the ability to sense danger under limited conditions―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Sensing danger... does that mean intuition like <STYLE ID="15">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> and mine...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right, <STYLE ID="16">Kana-chan's mother</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">"You said </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> has that kind of power too, didn't you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... has that kind of power too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What on earth... This book is simply stating facts, nothing more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I read on further.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Those whom a green-eyed child targets for killing are―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">green-eyed girls who have likewise had their first period, and those who possess the ability to sense danger.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Huh? So women with green eyes kill each other?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on top of that, they even kill those who can sense danger...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Driven by an unbearable desire to kill, they end up killing...<PG>
My hand, holding <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan's</STYLE>, went sweaty and began to tremble.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll come to want to kill <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And once <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> grows up a bit more, <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> will... me, too...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\蔵本棚真横.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死ぬ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, my hand, it hurts...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Ah, sorry!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜死にかけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
I quickly let go of <STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan's</STYLE> hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I'd squeezed too hard.<PG>
At last, I understood why I couldn't grieve over <STYLE ID="15">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm glad that <STYLE ID="15">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because of these eyes, the death of someone with the danger-sense ability―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Senpai's</STYLE> death is something I can't mourn or grieve.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, it's okay... There's nothing to be afraid of..."</STYLE>
