<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Kana-chan</STYLE> rubbed my back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
No, no, no...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't want to kill...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Rather than do something like that, I'd even gouge out these eyes...!<PG>
